  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog\n\n## 0.0.2\n\nUpdated README \n\n- The README's Quick start now shows how each can run\n\n## 0.0.1\n\nInitial release, built against `sdk_ui` 0.0.60 (Halo SDK 4.0.28).\n\n- Tap-on-phone payments and card-present refunds through the SDK's own screens\n- Printing, receipts and Zebra printer pairing\n- Branding through `brand.json`",
